sequenceDiagram
    actor Agent
    actor Reviewer
    participant API as agent-tasks API
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant Hook as Webhook handler
    participant Inbox as Signal inbox

    Note over Agent,Inbox: 1. Agent submits work
    Agent->>GH: gh pr create
    Agent->>API: task_submit_pr { taskId, branchName, prUrl, prNumber }
    Note right of API: records PR metadata, audit task.pr_submitted,<br/>no status change
    Agent->>API: task_finish { taskId, result }
    alt autoMerge: true (AUTONOMOUS only, else 403 autonomous_mode_required)
        API->>API: self-merge gate
        API->>GH: merge PR (delegated)
        Note right of API: status = done
    else no autoMerge
        Note right of API: status = review, audit task.transitioned
        API->>Inbox: review_needed
    end

    Note over Reviewer,Inbox: 2. Review and merge
    Inbox-->>Reviewer: review_needed
    Reviewer->>API: task_start (review claim)
    opt approve before merging
        Reviewer->>API: task_finish { outcome: approve }
        Note right of API: REQUIRES_DISTINCT_REVIEWER: 403 if the reviewer<br/>is the claimant, otherwise status = done
    end
    alt task_merge
        Reviewer->>API: POST /api/tasks/:id/merge
        API->>API: status gate (review or done), distinct-reviewer gate<br/>(from review), self-merge gate
        API->>GH: merge PR (delegated)
        Note right of API: status = done, audit github.pr_merged + task.merged
    else pull_requests_merge
        Reviewer->>API: POST /api/github/pull-requests/:prNumber/merge
        API->>API: same gates as task_merge
        API->>GH: merge PR (delegated)
        Note right of API: status = done, audit github.pr_merged
    else PR merged on GitHub
        GH-->>Hook: pull_request closed { merged: true }
        Hook->>Hook: pickMergeTargetStatus, then<br/>compare-and-swap status write
        Note over Hook: AUTONOMOUS: done.<br/>Other modes: open or in_progress<br/>to review, review unchanged.<br/>Done and backlog tasks: not matched.<br/>Audit task.transitioned,<br/>no gate, no signal
    end
